  instructions: "DESKTOP EXPERIENCE (Headset Off)\n\nYou are about to complete a
    learning activity using a standard desktop interface.\n\nActivity Structure:\n\u2022
    A series of infographic slides presented in a random order.\n\u2022 A short multiple-choice
    quiz designed to assess your understanding of the material.\n\nTiming:\n\u2022
    A timer is displayed in the top-left corner of each slide.\n\u2022 When the timer
    reaches zero, the next slide will automatically appear.\n\u2022 If a quiz question
    is not answered before time expires, it will be marked as incorrect.\n\nControls:\n\u2022
    Use your mouse and keyboard to navigate and interact with the content.\n\u2022
    Read each slide carefully and answer each question to the best of your ability."
